# NexaInsight Platform Release Notes
## Version 3.0 - January 2025

### New Features

**AI-Powered Data Preparation**
- Automatic data type detection and conversion
- Smart column mapping and transformation suggestions
- Anomaly detection during data ingestion

**Enhanced Collaboration**
- Real-time co-editing of dashboards
- Commenting and annotation on visualizations
- Shared workspaces for team projects

**Advanced Security**
- Row-level security for fine-grained access control
- Data masking for sensitive fields
- Enhanced audit logging

### Improvements
- 40% faster query performance
- Improved mobile app responsiveness
- Enhanced natural language query accuracy
- New dashboard templates

### Bug Fixes
- Fixed issue with date filtering in certain timezones
- Resolved memory leak in real-time data streaming
- Corrected calculation errors in certain aggregate functions

